game buzzbolt
press A
wait 10
press A
wait 10
cheat lives 3
cheat wave 4
cheat boss
waituntil boss_count == 2 200
expect foes_12 == 1
expect foes_13 == 1
botuntil boss_dead == 1 12000
expect boss_count == 0
waituntil state == 4 400
waituntil state == 3 400
expect wave == 5
